WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.233 --> 00:00:03.533
-Rhyhorn!

2
00:00:03.599 --> 00:00:06.533
Close your mouth! We don't want to bite your tongue!

3
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.700
Serena! Remember, you've got to think like a Rhyhorn!

4
00:00:09.766 --> 00:00:12.233
Easy for you to say!

5
00:00:12.299 --> 00:00:16.466
I've competed in Rhyhorn races around the world and you can do it, too!

6
00:00:16.533 --> 00:00:20.033
Just stay with it! Be one with Rhyhorn!

7
00:00:20.099 --> 00:00:22.200
Rhyhorn!

8
00:00:22.266 --> 00:00:23.300
Or not...

9
00:00:23.366 --> 00:00:28.933
Mom! I hate this!

10
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.900
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

11
00:00:31.966 --> 00:00:35.633
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

12
00:00:35.699 --> 00:00:38.233
♪ To catch them is my real test ♪

13
00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:41.233
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

14
00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:44.433
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all It's you and me ♪

15
00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:47.566
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

16
00:00:47.633 --> 00:00:50.933
♪ Pokémon! Yeah You're my best friend ♪

17
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.633
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

18
00:00:53.699 --> 00:00:55.866
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all ♪

19
00:00:55.933 --> 00:00:59.466
♪ Got to catch them all! Pokémon! ♪

20
00:01:08.066 --> 00:01:09.833
Excitement filled the air,

21
00:01:09.899 --> 00:01:13.066
as Ash and Pikachu arrived in the Kalos region!

22
00:01:13.133 --> 00:01:17.233
But as soon as they arrived, Team Rocket was after our heroes again!

23
00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:21.466
However, a brave Pokémon named Froakie saved the day!

24
00:01:21.533 --> 00:01:24.399
But Froakie took a lot of damage while battling.

25
00:01:24.466 --> 00:01:28.300
We join Ash as he races to Professor Sycamore's Pokémon lab,

26
00:01:28.366 --> 00:01:30.533
with an injured Froakie in his arms!

27
00:01:32.166 --> 00:01:33.966
This way! Hurry up!

28
00:01:34.033 --> 00:01:37.166
Okay! Froakie, you've got to hang in there!

29
00:01:37.233 --> 00:01:38.633
Froakie...

30
00:01:38.699 --> 00:01:43.433
- Clemont! Go faster!!
- I'm running as fast as I can.

31
00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:47.333
- Ash, don't wait for me! Get going!
- You got it, Clemont!

32
00:01:47.399 --> 00:01:49.833
I can't believe how slow my brother is!

33
00:01:55.899 --> 00:01:58.833
- Unforgivable!
- And embarrassing!

34
00:01:58.899 --> 00:02:00.366
- Ash! This way!
- Right!

35
00:02:00.433 --> 00:02:01.333
Huh?

36
00:02:01.399 --> 00:02:04.333
That's it! The Sycamore Pokémon lab!

37
00:02:04.399 --> 00:02:08.333
- It's the toddling Twerp!
- Sycamore Pokémon research lab?

38
00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:11.066
It must be for studying Pokémon.

39
00:02:11.133 --> 00:02:16.133
I'll wager all the strong and rare Pokémon in there would make you fall over.

40
00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:18.400
Wobbuffet!

41
00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:29.033
Hello! Professor Sycamore, are you here?!

42
00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:32.233
Coming! Huh?

43
00:02:32.299 --> 00:02:35.799
Are you the professor?

44
00:02:35.866 --> 00:02:37.900
- Froakie, no!
- Huh?

45
00:02:37.966 --> 00:02:39.966
You know this Froakie, Professor?

46
00:02:40.033 --> 00:02:44.433
I sure do. Sophie, come quick! We've been so worried about you.

47
00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:47.633
Your Trainer has been in recent contact with us.

48
00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:52.000
- Froakie needs help.
- Right!

49
00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:56.000
- Pika!
- Thanks, Professor.

50
00:02:56.066 --> 00:02:58.233
We've been worried about Froakie, too.

51
00:02:58.299 --> 00:03:00.566
So is Froakie's Trainer on the way here now?

52
00:03:00.633 --> 00:03:05.900
I'm afraid not. He contacted us to let us know he wanted to give up Froakie.

53
00:03:05.966 --> 00:03:08.066
- Huh?
- Pika Pika!

54
00:03:12.933 --> 00:03:16.866
- You're so slow!
- How's Froakie?

55
00:03:16.933 --> 00:03:18.866
Froakie...

56
00:03:24.366 --> 00:03:25.733
Poor Froakie!

57
00:03:25.799 --> 00:03:27.866
- There's nothing to worry about.
- Huh?

58
00:03:27.933 --> 00:03:31.299
Sophie is the absolute best at what she does!

59
00:03:31.366 --> 00:03:32.833
Great!

60
00:03:35.233 --> 00:03:39.500
I'm Professor Sycamore. I'm a Pokémon researcher working here in Kalos.

61
00:03:39.566 --> 00:03:41.666
Nice to meet you! My name's Ash

62
00:03:41.733 --> 00:03:44.133
and this is my partner, Pikachu! -Pika!

63
00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:47.100
My name's Bonnie and this is my brother Clemont!

64
00:03:47.166 --> 00:03:50.299
It's truly an honor to meet you, Professor Sycamore!

65
00:03:50.366 --> 00:03:53.733
Pikachu and I got here today from Pallet Town in Kanto.

66
00:03:53.799 --> 00:03:55.466
- From Kanto?
- Right!

67
00:03:55.533 --> 00:03:59.033
I'm traveling on a journey so I can become a Pokémon Master!

68
00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:01.466
- Pikachu!
- Then welcome!

69
00:04:01.533 --> 00:04:06.133
Forgive me for not thanking you yet for saving Froakie. It's much appreciated.

70
00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:11.666
The truth is Froakie saved us! So what's the deal with Froakie's Trainer?

71
00:04:11.733 --> 00:04:14.666
What happened that would make him give Froakie up?

72
00:04:14.733 --> 00:04:18.099
Well, one of my numerous responsibilities is to give Trainers

73
00:04:18.166 --> 00:04:19.866
their very first Pokémon.

74
00:04:19.933 --> 00:04:23.300
Froakie's a Pokémon meant for new Trainers.

75
00:04:23.366 --> 00:04:26.200
But this particular Froakie is a bit different,

76
00:04:26.266 --> 00:04:29.400
refusing to listen to its Trainer during battle.

77
00:04:29.466 --> 00:04:31.933
There have been times when Froakie ran away,

78
00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:34.000
simply because it didn't like its Trainer!

79
00:04:34.066 --> 00:04:37.366
And several Trainers have come back to my lab just to return it.

80
00:04:37.433 --> 00:04:40.133
- Huh?
- You mean more than one?!

81
00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:41.333
Pikachu.

82
00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:43.533
I'm sure Froakie acts that way for a reason.

83
00:04:43.599 --> 00:04:45.900
So Froakie's had a hard life.

84
00:04:45.966 --> 00:04:50.066
I've heard quite a few rumors about a new Trainer's first Pokémon like that,

85
00:04:50.133 --> 00:04:52.766
but it seemed absurd, so I never believed them!

86
00:04:52.833 --> 00:04:54.400
- Gar, gar!
- Huh?

87
00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:59.133
Gar. Gar, Gar, Gar. Gar!

88
00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:02.933
- Oh! Check it out! It's a Garchomp!
- Pika Pikachu!

89
00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:07.200
Garchomp lives here at the lab. It has a good heart.

90
00:05:07.266 --> 00:05:08.766
Gar!

91
00:05:08.833 --> 00:05:12.833
- Garchomp, how are you feeling?
- Gar.

92
00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:15.200
- Froak!
- Gar.

93
00:05:15.266 --> 00:05:19.500
Froakie will be fine. Don't worry. You can thank these people.

94
00:05:19.566 --> 00:05:22.933
- Gar, Gar!
- Nice to meet you, Garchomp!

95
00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:24.033
Pika, Pika.

96
00:05:24.099 --> 00:05:28.433
You really care a lot, don't you? Froakie's going to be okay. Promise!

97
00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:30.000
Gar, Gar!

98
00:05:30.066 --> 00:05:34.166
May I pet Garchomp too, please? I've never seen a real Garchomp before!

99
00:05:34.233 --> 00:05:37.400
Of course. Garchomp would really like that!

100
00:05:37.466 --> 00:05:43.133
Yay! Aw, you're so cute! Good Pokémon! Hey, you like me!

101
00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:44.666
- Professor?
- Hm?

102
00:05:44.733 --> 00:05:49.166
I've heard a lot about your research on Pokémon Evolution. Is it true?

103
00:05:49.233 --> 00:05:53.933
Yeah! There are a lot more Pokémon living right here at the lab than Garchomp.

104
00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:55.766
Oh, I want to see them!

105
00:05:55.833 --> 00:05:58.133
Well, I think we can do something about that.

106
00:05:58.200 --> 00:06:02.266
- Cosette, look after Garchomp, won't you?
- Of course. Sure thing!

107
00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:06.200
Huh? Aren't you coming, Ash?

108
00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:09.300
Yeah. I'll catch up with you.

109
00:06:09.366 --> 00:06:11.333
Oh, okay.

110
00:06:16.333 --> 00:06:20.166
Hey, Froakie, I really want to thank you for saving me.

111
00:06:20.233 --> 00:06:21.433
Pika, Pika!

112
00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:25.966
- Pikachu and I think you're awesome!
- Froakie!

113
00:06:26.033 --> 00:06:29.166
I don't get it. I'd want a Pokémon like you.

114
00:06:29.233 --> 00:06:32.733
Look what you did! You cared enough to save Pikachu.

115
00:06:32.799 --> 00:06:34.866
- You're the best!
- Pika!

116
00:06:38.900 --> 00:06:41.833
Wow!

117
00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:45.033
Pika!

118
00:06:45.099 --> 00:06:49.166
- Wow! Amazing!
- So Ash, how's Froakie feeling?

119
00:06:49.233 --> 00:06:54.466
- Much better! Froakie's real strong!
- Ash! I've never seen these Pokémon!

120
00:06:54.533 --> 00:06:56.966
There's almost too many Pokémon to count!

121
00:06:57.033 --> 00:07:01.033
- Wow, there's even an Helioptile!
- Pika, Pika!

122
00:07:01.099 --> 00:07:03.466
-Pika!

123
00:07:03.533 --> 00:07:07.933
So, Professor, what kind of Evolution are you researching?

124
00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:13.233
Well, if I told you that Pokémon may have an additional evolutionary stage,

125
00:07:13.299 --> 00:07:15.833
- what would you say?
- Are you serious?!

126
00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:18.766
So you're saying that Garchomp can still evolve?!

127
00:07:18.833 --> 00:07:20.700
Possibly. That's my research.

128
00:07:20.766 --> 00:07:23.099
- Wow
- Unbelievable!

129
00:07:23.166 --> 00:07:27.033
There have been several reports about different Pokémon evolving in a way

130
00:07:27.099 --> 00:07:29.833
that we researchers refer to as Mega Evolution.

131
00:07:29.900 --> 00:07:31.833
Mega Evolution?

132
00:07:32.833 --> 00:07:36.333
A lot of the mechanics are still a mystery,

133
00:07:36.400 --> 00:07:40.133
but we believe that a strong bond between Pokémon and Trainer,

134
00:07:40.200 --> 00:07:44.000
as well as a special stone, play a crucial role in evolving!

135
00:07:44.066 --> 00:07:46.966
- Strong bond, huh?
- Pika.

136
00:07:47.033 --> 00:07:49.566
What's more, a Pokémon's able to return to

137
00:07:49.633 --> 00:07:52.466
its previous form after it evolves this way!

138
00:07:52.533 --> 00:07:55.433
Oh! It can turn back?

139
00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:58.033
Mega Evolution! Strong stuff...

140
00:07:58.099 --> 00:08:00.633
Further evolution, after evolving!

141
00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:03.599
The way is clear! Every Pokémon's ours!

142
00:08:03.666 --> 00:08:05.666
Catching time's here!

143
00:08:05.733 --> 00:08:07.200
- Wobbuffet!
- Shush!

144
00:08:09.599 --> 00:08:14.000
- Oh, fellow researchers?
- We've come to research Mega Evolution!

145
00:08:14.066 --> 00:08:15.900
You have?

146
00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:19.500
Fro!

147
00:08:19.566 --> 00:08:21.166
Kie...

148
00:08:21.233 --> 00:08:23.666
We've come to be of scientific service!

149
00:08:23.733 --> 00:08:26.733
I wasn't told anything about this.

150
00:08:26.799 --> 00:08:31.500
I'll check with the professor.

151
00:08:31.566 --> 00:08:35.900
- Gar!
- Froakie! Froakie!

152
00:08:35.966 --> 00:08:38.299
- Froakie!
- Gar?

153
00:08:38.366 --> 00:08:40.833
That's the Froakie that blasted us off!

154
00:08:40.900 --> 00:08:44.266
Then that's the one who should feel our research wrath first.

155
00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:47.833
So, let's get ready to research!

156
00:08:47.900 --> 00:08:51.833
Now, please, step aside! This procedure is not for the faint of heart!

157
00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:55.166
- Voilà!
- Gar!

158
00:08:55.233 --> 00:08:58.033
Gar!

159
00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:01.666
Ah! Oh, no, Garchomp!

160
00:09:01.733 --> 00:09:04.033
Not our intended target, but whatever!

161
00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:07.233
They did say Garchomp might be able to Mega Evolve.

162
00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:10.000
Let's roll with the punches! It's a Garchomp grab!

163
00:09:10.066 --> 00:09:12.566
Garchomp, we insist that you come along for the ride!

164
00:09:12.633 --> 00:09:14.566
Gar!

165
00:09:14.633 --> 00:09:19.133
- Kie!
- Garchomp!

166
00:09:20.933 --> 00:09:24.066
- Gar!
- Huh?

167
00:09:24.133 --> 00:09:25.766
Hey, that's Garchomp!

168
00:09:25.833 --> 00:09:28.699
Gar!

169
00:09:35.900 --> 00:09:38.500
Hold on! This isn't how we planned it!

170
00:09:38.566 --> 00:09:41.166
Come on, Garchomp, go with the program!

171
00:09:41.233 --> 00:09:45.933
- Most peculiar.
- Gar!

172
00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:48.699
- Garchomp! What's going on?!
- Pika!

173
00:09:48.766 --> 00:09:50.866
Professor! Those three did this!

174
00:09:50.933 --> 00:09:54.133
Huh? All right, who are you?!

175
00:09:54.199 --> 00:09:56.133
Prepare for trouble, all right, we're us!

176
00:09:56.199 --> 00:09:59.100
And make it double, no muss, no fuss!

177
00:10:00.199 --> 00:10:04.166
- Oh, no, Team Rocket!
- You are such annoying bad people!!

178
00:10:04.233 --> 00:10:05.566
Team Rocket?!

179
00:10:05.633 --> 00:10:08.633
They're bad guys who try to steal everybody's Pokémon!

180
00:10:08.699 --> 00:10:10.866
Try?! We succeed!

181
00:10:10.933 --> 00:10:13.466
And today, Garchomp will fill that need!

182
00:10:13.533 --> 00:10:15.866
There's nothing like doing an evil deed!

183
00:10:15.933 --> 00:10:17.866
It can't be! A talking Meowth?!

184
00:10:17.933 --> 00:10:20.466
The wisdom gushes out of my mouth.

185
00:10:20.533 --> 00:10:22.500
Gar!

186
00:10:22.566 --> 00:10:26.666
- Ah! Foul! No fair!
- Wobbuffet!

187
00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:31.800
-What, Garchomp?!

188
00:10:31.866 --> 00:10:34.400
What's going on?!

189
00:10:34.466 --> 00:10:36.633
Look out! Whoa!

190
00:10:37.633 --> 00:10:39.133
What was that for?!

191
00:10:39.199 --> 00:10:41.000
Hey! Look at Garchomp's neck!

192
00:10:41.066 --> 00:10:45.466
-It's some sort of collar!

193
00:10:45.533 --> 00:10:48.066
- It's from those people!
- What?!

194
00:10:48.133 --> 00:10:51.266
Garchomp jumped in to save Froakie.

195
00:10:54.266 --> 00:10:55.933
Gar!

196
00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:59.400
- Garchomp!
- Pika!

197
00:10:59.466 --> 00:11:02.000
Garchomp must be in a lot of pain!

198
00:11:02.066 --> 00:11:04.366
What's going to happen to Garchomp?

199
00:11:04.433 --> 00:11:06.199
- Let's go after it!
- Pika!

200
00:11:06.266 --> 00:11:08.066
Please, be very careful!

201
00:11:08.133 --> 00:11:11.300
Sophie, check to see if the other Pokémon are okay!

202
00:11:11.366 --> 00:11:14.733
Oh, Clemont, I wish we could help poor Garchomp out.

203
00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:16.300
- Then let's go, too!
- Hm!

204
00:11:16.366 --> 00:11:18.233
-Kie!

205
00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:20.933
- Froakie, what?!
- Froak!

206
00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:23.533
- Great! You want to come?
- Pika!

207
00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:24.933
- Froak Froak!
- Pika!

208
00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:27.466
Who's that Pokémon?”

209
00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:33.600
It's Froakie!

210
00:11:33.666 --> 00:11:35.699
Froakie!

211
00:11:39.766 --> 00:11:42.100
Gar!

212
00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:50.433
Gar! Gar! Gar! Gar!

213
00:11:50.500 --> 00:11:53.033
-Attention, citizens!

214
00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:56.233
There's a Garchomp currently on a wild rampage!

215
00:11:56.300 --> 00:11:58.600
Please evacuate the area immediately!

216
00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:07.000
At present, Garchomp is flying toward Prism Tower!

217
00:12:08.066 --> 00:12:12.333
Gar!

218
00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:15.199
Gar!

219
00:12:16.966 --> 00:12:19.966
Garchomp is now unleashing random Hyper Beams!

220
00:12:20.033 --> 00:12:23.033
It just aimed one straight at our helicopter!

221
00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:25.900
Garchomp seems extremely agitated!

222
00:12:25.966 --> 00:12:31.133
Hm. Have a look at this. Something unbelievable is happening!

223
00:12:31.199 --> 00:12:35.400
Oh, yeah? Well, something unbelievable has happened to my face, okay?

224
00:12:35.466 --> 00:12:37.400
Ah! Ow.

225
00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:42.900
Hm? What movie is this?

226
00:12:42.966 --> 00:12:47.300
It's real and live from Lumiose City! Something awful's going on.

227
00:12:47.366 --> 00:12:49.400
Gar!

228
00:12:49.466 --> 00:12:51.633
Garchomp! Huh?

229
00:12:51.699 --> 00:12:53.366
Pikachu!

230
00:12:53.433 --> 00:12:56.133
There you are, Ash!

231
00:12:56.199 --> 00:12:58.866
I've got to try and get close to it.

232
00:12:58.933 --> 00:13:03.033
- Uh, but that's dangerous!
- No, Garchomp's the one who's in danger!

233
00:13:03.099 --> 00:13:05.566
I've got to find a way to get that collar off!

234
00:13:05.633 --> 00:13:07.633
- Fro?
- Hm.

235
00:13:07.699 --> 00:13:11.199
I know! If getting close to Garchomp is what you need to do,

236
00:13:11.266 --> 00:13:14.166
- I think I just came up with a way!
- You did?

237
00:13:16.066 --> 00:13:19.199
There's an emergency stairwell through that door.

238
00:13:19.266 --> 00:13:21.733
- Good thing I brought my backpack!
- Huh?

239
00:13:21.800 --> 00:13:25.300
Hm. The future is now, thanks to science!

240
00:13:25.366 --> 00:13:29.466
All right, Clemontic Gear, On! Aipom Arm, go!

241
00:13:30.466 --> 00:13:33.166
- Wow! Check that out!
- Pika!

242
00:13:33.233 --> 00:13:34.900
-Now we can get in!

243
00:13:34.966 --> 00:13:37.433
Man, science is so amazing!

244
00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:40.633
You've got that right! It's my brother's invention!

245
00:13:40.699 --> 00:13:43.233
I must admit, I'm kind of good at these sorts of things.

246
00:13:45.133 --> 00:13:47.300
- Thanks, Clemont!
- Sure thing!

247
00:13:47.366 --> 00:13:49.699
- Huh? Whoa!
- Whoa!

248
00:13:49.766 --> 00:13:51.433
-Froak!

249
00:13:51.500 --> 00:13:54.633
Clemont! Bonnie! You okay?

250
00:13:54.699 --> 00:13:58.000
Yeah. Don't worry about us! You just get going!

251
00:13:58.066 --> 00:13:59.366
Okay, I'm on it!

252
00:14:03.066 --> 00:14:05.533
- Officer Jenny!
- Professor Sycamore!

253
00:14:05.599 --> 00:14:08.300
I'm so sorry about the trouble. So where's Garchomp?

254
00:14:08.366 --> 00:14:10.666
- Hey, up there!
- Huh?

255
00:14:10.733 --> 00:14:12.933
It's some kid!

256
00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:14.933
- What?! It's Ash!
- Ah!

257
00:14:18.733 --> 00:14:20.733
Hey, Garchomp.

258
00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:23.033
Gar!

259
00:14:28.666 --> 00:14:32.099
- Oh, I wonder if Ash is all right.
- Hm.

260
00:14:32.166 --> 00:14:35.099
Ah! Please, Garchomp, you've got to calm down!

261
00:14:37.166 --> 00:14:40.066
- Fro!
- Pikachu!

262
00:14:41.800 --> 00:14:47.166
There's a boy up on Prism Tower! Could he be trying to talk to Garchomp?

263
00:14:47.233 --> 00:14:49.633
I wonder if that kid's Garchomp's Trainer?

264
00:14:54.566 --> 00:14:57.300
- Garchomp, come back!
- Pika!

265
00:15:00.233 --> 00:15:01.866
Hm.

266
00:15:02.833 --> 00:15:04.066
Huh?

267
00:15:10.066 --> 00:15:11.699
- Huh?
- There they are!

268
00:15:11.766 --> 00:15:16.166
I can't believe how brave Ash is when it comes to helping out Pokémon!

269
00:15:21.366 --> 00:15:22.866
I need to get up there!

270
00:15:22.933 --> 00:15:25.199
Wait! I'm going with you!

271
00:15:28.099 --> 00:15:29.866
Now...

272
00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:34.933
- Take my hand, Bonnie!
- Oh! Thank you!

273
00:15:37.533 --> 00:15:41.033
Gar! Gar!

274
00:15:42.366 --> 00:15:44.366
I'm here to help, Garchomp!

275
00:15:44.433 --> 00:15:49.633
Unbelievable! That boy has climbed to the top of Prism Tower!

276
00:15:49.699 --> 00:15:52.633
- Gar!
- Argh!

277
00:15:54.766 --> 00:15:57.366
- Pika!
- No, Pikachu!

278
00:15:57.433 --> 00:15:59.066
- Pika?
- Wait.

279
00:15:59.133 --> 00:16:01.400
I don't want you to attack Garchomp.

280
00:16:01.466 --> 00:16:03.500
Pikachu!

281
00:16:06.166 --> 00:16:10.566
- Pull yourself together, Clemont!
- Ah! My legs! Huh? Where's Ash?

282
00:16:10.633 --> 00:16:13.333
Up there! At the top of the tower!

283
00:16:16.666 --> 00:16:22.199
Garchomp! Can you hear me? I know it hurts. You're in a lot of pain!

284
00:16:22.266 --> 00:16:23.699
Pika!

285
00:16:23.766 --> 00:16:25.866
- Fro!
- We just want to help you.

286
00:16:25.933 --> 00:16:29.433
Please, let me get that collar off of you, so we can go back down!

287
00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:33.199
-Please. So what do you say?

288
00:16:43.666 --> 00:16:45.900
Wait! Garchomp, look out!

289
00:16:46.933 --> 00:16:49.099
Fro!

290
00:16:49.166 --> 00:16:52.400
Good thinking, Froakie!

291
00:16:52.466 --> 00:16:54.633
We've got to destroy that collar!

292
00:16:54.699 --> 00:16:56.933
Pikachu!

293
00:16:57.000 --> 00:17:01.166
Garchomp! Hang on and I'll get this thing off of you!

294
00:17:01.233 --> 00:17:04.633
-Pikachu, use Iron Tail on the collar!

295
00:17:04.700 --> 00:17:09.333
Pika! Chu! Battle Cry!

296
00:17:12.599 --> 00:17:17.300
-Are you okay?

297
00:17:17.366 --> 00:17:19.166
- Kie, Kie! Fro!
- Pika!

298
00:17:19.233 --> 00:17:21.099
- Gar!
- That must've hurt.

299
00:17:21.166 --> 00:17:23.633
Help's on the way. Don't worry!

300
00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:27.966
- Pika!
- Huh? Pikachu!

301
00:17:28.033 --> 00:17:29.100
Pika!

302
00:17:37.533 --> 00:17:39.633
Pikachu!

303
00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:41.700
Pikachu!

304
00:17:41.766 --> 00:17:43.600
Whoa!

305
00:17:43.666 --> 00:17:46.066
What's that?

306
00:17:46.133 --> 00:17:48.066
- Pika?
- Whoa, it's you!

307
00:17:49.066 --> 00:17:50.966
That Pokémon!

308
00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:59.333
- Thanks a lot!
- Blaze!

309
00:17:59.399 --> 00:18:00.833
- Huh?
- Pika?

310
00:18:00.899 --> 00:18:03.700
-What a relief!

311
00:18:05.066 --> 00:18:07.733
- Fro! Froakie!
- Gar!

312
00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:10.233
- Hey, Ash, Pikachu!
- Huh?

313
00:18:10.300 --> 00:18:12.733
Thank goodness the two of you didn't get hurt!

314
00:18:12.800 --> 00:18:16.533
We're both doing great and Garchomp's all back to normal!

315
00:18:16.600 --> 00:18:20.700
Thank you, Ash. Officer Jenny is on her way to get them now.

316
00:18:20.766 --> 00:18:22.966
Professor, about that Pokémon...

317
00:18:28.700 --> 00:18:32.633
- Great job, Blaziken!
- Blaziken!

318
00:18:35.466 --> 00:18:39.866
That was Blaziken's Mega Evolution. That's Mega Blaziken.

319
00:18:39.933 --> 00:18:44.033
- Mega Blaziken?
- Another research topic for me!

320
00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:47.766
Mega Blaziken! Thanks for everything!

321
00:18:47.833 --> 00:18:49.933
Pika Pika!

322
00:18:51.866 --> 00:18:54.300
Ah! What a relief!

323
00:18:56.266 --> 00:18:59.633
Huh? That boy. No, it couldn't be...

324
00:19:03.633 --> 00:19:07.533
Hope you all got some sleep, even though it's a mess in there.

325
00:19:07.600 --> 00:19:11.399
- Yeah! I slept like a log!
- Best sleep I've had in a long time!

326
00:19:11.466 --> 00:19:12.800
Thank you for everything!

327
00:19:12.866 --> 00:19:16.233
I guess your real journey begins now, doesn't it, Ash?

328
00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:19.000
- Yup!
- Oh and by the way, have you received

329
00:19:19.066 --> 00:19:21.600
- a Kalos region Pokédex yet?
- No!

330
00:19:21.666 --> 00:19:25.333
Then please take this with you on your journey and make good use of it!

331
00:19:26.766 --> 00:19:28.866
Thanks a lot, Professor!

332
00:19:28.933 --> 00:19:31.533
- Are you ready to go, buddy?
- Pikachu!

333
00:19:31.600 --> 00:19:34.266
Good luck with your research, Professor! Bye!

334
00:19:34.333 --> 00:19:36.333
Whoa!

335
00:19:37.433 --> 00:19:40.366
Froakie!

336
00:19:41.666 --> 00:19:42.966
Fro!

337
00:19:43.033 --> 00:19:45.266
Hey, I think it wants to go with you.

338
00:19:45.333 --> 00:19:48.200
I can't believe it! Froakie chose you!

339
00:19:48.266 --> 00:19:50.933
It really likes Ash! That's so sweet!

340
00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:58.266
You think so, huh? So, Froakie, do you want to come with us?

341
00:19:58.333 --> 00:20:00.800
- Froakie!
- Hm? Huh?

342
00:20:02.500 --> 00:20:06.000
It's awesome you're coming with us, Froakie!

343
00:20:06.066 --> 00:20:08.899
Pikachu, Froakie's our first friend in Kalos!

344
00:20:08.966 --> 00:20:10.466
Pika!

345
00:20:10.533 --> 00:20:13.766
Yes! I got a Froakie! Yeah!

346
00:20:13.833 --> 00:20:16.166
Pika! Pikachu!

347
00:20:16.233 --> 00:20:20.633
Our hero has his first Pokémon from the Kalos region, Froakie!

348
00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:23.700
Now, what other friends and adventures await Ash?

349
00:20:23.766 --> 00:20:26.533
Find out, as the journey continues!

350
00:20:28.000 --> 00:20:32.700
- Breakfast! Eat it all up!
- Rhy!

351
00:20:32.766 --> 00:20:35.500
Wow, Rhyhorn.

352
00:20:35.566 --> 00:20:39.666
I have this feeling something interesting's about to happen!

353
00:20:41.266 --> 00:20:42.933
It must be that boy!

354
00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:46.133
Right! Let's go!
